{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16963","headline":"南徐别业早春有怀 · 武元衡","name":"南徐别业早春有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生涯扰扰竟何成，自爱深居隐姓名。\n远雁临空翻夕照，残云带雨过春城。\n花枝入户犹含润，泉水侵堦乍有声。\n虚度年华不相见，离肠怀土并关情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}